Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:04.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Edwin, student number 25092450.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:08.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Atlantic widens by about 2–3 cm a year — about as fast as your fingernails grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.30,0:00:12.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's because the plates on either side of the mid-ocean ridge are moving apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:17.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,One side's speed is the half-spreading rate; both sides together give the full-spreading rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:22.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,But no one can watch a plate for millions of years — so how do we measure its speed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:23.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the mid-ocean ridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.05,0:00:26.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The two paper strips are the seafloor on either side of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.05,0:00:27.55,Anno,,0,0,0,,{\an6\pos(560,640)\fad(220,220)}Mid-ocean ridge\N{\fs28\b0\c&HF0E8E0&}cardboard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.15,0:00:26.25,Anno,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1290,560)\fad(220,220)}Seafloor\N{\fs28\b0\c&HF0E8E0&}paper strips
