Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.55,0:00:32.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,just like new oceanic crust forming at the ridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.15,0:00:36.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,As the rock cools, it records the direction of Earth's magnetic field at that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.85,0:00:36.35,Anno,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1290,470)\fad(220,220)}Magnetic stripes\N{\fs28\b0\c&HF0E8E0&}record the field's polarity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:36.35,Line,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(0,0)\fad(260,220)\p1}m 1279 468 l 1127 589 1129 591 1280 471{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:36.35,Line,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(1128,590)\fad(260,220)\p1}m 0 -7 b 4 -7 7 -4 7 0 b 7 4 4 7 0 7 b -4 7 -7 4 -7 0 b -7 -4 -4 -7 0 -7{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:40.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,The magnetic patterns on the two strips are perfectly symmetric.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.25,0:00:40.50,Anno,,0,0,0,,{\an6\pos(590,565)\fad(220,220)}Mirror image\N{\fs28\b0\c&HF0E8E0&}same pattern on both sides
